2026-07-27T11:44:29.6966192Z i /tmp/RtmpoYNH3P/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6966471Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6967046Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6967394Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6967809Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6968384Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:44:29.6968921Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
